# The FIMC-IS camera nodes answer VIDIOC_ENUM_FMT with success forever, so
# anything that enumerates /dev/video* formats (GStreamer's device provider,
# i.e. Cheese) loops until memory runs out and the low-memory killer takes out
# Xorg. Hide them; camd opens its own nodes under /dev/camd made from the sysfs dev numbers.
# Remove this once the driver's enum_fmt handlers return -EINVAL.
SUBSYSTEM=="video4linux", ATTR{name}=="exynos-fimc-is-*", RUN+="/bin/rm -f /dev/%k"
